            "review_title": "Review at Pho Trinh",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20545 contributions\n1\nGood start of the day\nJan 2026 • Couples\nOpened only mornings, known by locals, foreigners living in Thao Dien or visitors. Forty years serving Vietnamese famous soup. No eating after order, soup is served instantly, place is under the roof on the street or close to busy crossroad, noise could be higher. Limited menu focusing on pho and great value for money\nWritten January 9, 2026",
